WEBVTT

00:01:20.686 --> 00:01:21.937
There it is.

00:01:40.331 --> 00:01:41.832
You saved my life.

00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:43.542
Of course. Why wouldn't I?

00:01:43.626 --> 00:01:47.296
I just can't believe you would do that
for a human.

00:01:47.379 --> 00:01:50.215
Humans, monsters, what's the difference?

00:01:50.299 --> 00:01:53.010
Yeah, right. Right.

00:01:53.469 --> 00:01:55.471
Wait. What are you doing here?

00:01:56.305 --> 00:01:59.475
Well, you know,
vampires can predict the future,

00:01:59.558 --> 00:02:02.353
so I knew you would need my help.

00:02:03.395 --> 00:02:04.647
Never heard that before.

00:02:04.772 --> 00:02:06.899
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
It's a well-known fact.

00:02:08.233 --> 00:02:09.735
What are you doing here?

00:02:10.986 --> 00:02:12.905
Well, I'm here to get that.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:14.865
Yeah, it's a family heirloom.

00:02:14.949 --> 00:02:19.495
Yeah, it was lost at sea,
and my great-grandfather is... Was!

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:22.957
Was totally obsessed
with getting it back.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:27.336
So, any who, thanks for saving my life,
but I can take it from...

00:02:33.258 --> 00:02:34.593
Got to be a little more careful.

00:02:34.677 --> 00:02:36.470
How many times
can you save my life, right?

00:02:36.553 --> 00:02:38.472
I don't know. Every time?

00:02:39.139 --> 00:02:41.308
Really? Well, then...

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:38.073
That was incredible.

00:03:50.836 --> 00:03:53.964
Don't you want to get
your family heirloom thingy?

00:03:55.466 --> 00:03:56.508
Right.

00:04:02.639 --> 00:04:03.766
Got it.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.173
Here, let me get that for you.

00:04:39.351 --> 00:04:40.467
Dad!

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:42.471
Mavis!

00:04:43.347 --> 00:04:44.883
What are you doing to my father?

00:04:45.057 --> 00:04:46.350
Wait!

00:04:47.101 --> 00:04:49.144
Mavis, stop! Put her down!

00:04:49.228 --> 00:04:52.397
No! She's trying to hurt you.
Why can't you see that?

00:04:53.958 --> 00:04:56.485
Because I...

00:04:56.944 --> 00:04:58.403
Because I Zinged.

00:04:59.905 --> 00:05:03.283
-What?
-I Zinged with Ericka.

00:05:04.493 --> 00:05:06.286
No, that can't be true.

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.080
You only Zing once.

00:05:08.163 --> 00:05:10.499
That's what I thought, too.

00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:13.001
"Zing"? What's a Zing?

00:05:13.585 --> 00:05:16.588
Well, it's a thing for monsters.

00:05:17.256 --> 00:05:19.925
It's kind of like
our "love at first sight."

00:05:20.008 --> 00:05:22.719
What? No. No, no, no.

00:05:22.803 --> 00:05:25.139
-You don't even know me.
-Well, not yet.

00:05:25.222 --> 00:05:27.516
-But we're just...
-No, you don't understand.

00:05:27.599 --> 00:05:29.184
I can't be with you.

00:05:29.268 --> 00:05:31.812
I could never be with someone like you.

00:05:32.187 --> 00:05:33.355
I could never be with

00:05:34.273 --> 00:05:35.399
a monster.

00:05:46.076 --> 00:05:48.370
Dad, I'm so sorry.

00:05:48.787 --> 00:05:50.539
-I...
-It doesn't matter.

00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:54.585
You heard what she said.

00:06:02.301 --> 00:06:04.094
But a Zing never lies.

00:06:19.067 --> 00:06:20.402
You got it!

00:06:21.528 --> 00:06:22.821
Yes.

00:06:27.117 --> 00:06:29.661
Now that we have
the instrument of destruction,

00:06:29.745 --> 00:06:32.581
our family legacy will be fulfilled.

00:06:32.664 --> 00:06:37.211
But first, we'll draw them in
with a dance party!

00:06:37.294 --> 00:06:38.462
I love to dance.

00:06:53.852 --> 00:06:55.479
Frank, could you zip me up?

00:06:55.562 --> 00:06:57.022
We're gonna be late.

00:06:57.856 --> 00:06:59.399
Where did you get those?

00:06:59.983 --> 00:07:01.652
See, here's the funny thing.

00:07:01.902 --> 00:07:04.696
I lost my hands gambling,
but... It's no big deal!

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:06.740
Look, I got these
from the seafood buffet.

00:07:06.865 --> 00:07:09.243
Look at this. Clickety-click, click,
clack, clack, click, click.

00:07:09.326 --> 00:07:11.370
I kind of like 'em. I like 'em.

